<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Algorithm Steps</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fff8e8;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #b26a00;
        }

        .step {
            background: #fff2cc;
            margin: 15px 0;
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .number {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #b26a00;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>🧠 How to Create an Algorithm</h1>

    <div class="step">
        <span class="number">1.</span>
        <h2>Understand the Problem</h2>
        <p>Read the problem carefully and identify what needs to be solved.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
        <span class="number">2.</span>
        <h2>Identify Input</h2>
        <p>Determine what information is required by the program.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
        <span class="number">3.</span>
        <h2>Plan the Steps</h2>
        <p>Write the logical steps needed to solve the problem.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
        <span class="number">4.</span>
        <h2>Produce Output</h2>
        <p>Determine the expected result of the algorithm.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
        <span class="number">5.</span>
        <h2>Test the Algorithm</h2>
        <p>Check the steps using different examples and inputs.</p>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
